			"hadithnumber": 1615,
			"arabicnumber": 1615,
			"text": "Narrated Anas: That the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said: \"There is no 'Adwa and no Tiyarah, and I like Fa'l.\" They said: \"O Messenger of Allah! What is Fa'l?\" He said: \"A good statement.\" [Abu 'Eisa said:] This Hadith is Hasan Sahih",
